$DATUM (3S,4aS,7aR,8R,11aS,11bR)-Methyl
3,8,11a-Trimethyl-6-oxo-3-ethyltetradecahydro-1H-dibenzo[b,d]azepin-8-carboxylate
(23). A solution of E-oxime 21 (0.30 g, 0.86 mmol) in anhydrous dioxane
(20 mL) at 0°C was treated dropwise with freshly distilled SOCl2 (2 mL),
stirred for 10 min at 0°C and 1 h at room temperature, treated with H2O
(30 mL), and extracted with CHCl3 (3 × 40 mL). The organic layer was
washed with H2O (3 × 40 mL) and dried over MgSO4. The solvent was
evaporated in vacuo. The residue was chromatographed over a column of
silica gel (CHCl3 eluent). Yield (0.28 g, 93%). C21H35NO3. [α]20D-0.34°
(c 3.11, CHCl3 ). IR spectrum (ν, cm-1): 1246, 1387, 1435, 1460, 1665,
1703, 1722, 2883, 2939, 2957, 3429. 1H NMR spectrum (δ, ppm, J/Hz): 0.70
(3H, s, CH3-18), 0.70 (3H, t, J = 7.6, CH3-17), 0.94 (3H, s, CH3-21),
0.95-1.03 (4H, m, H-11, 9, 2, 11b), 1.10 (3H, s, CH3-20), 1.11-1.14 (2H,
m, H-16, 16), 1.16-1.21 (1H, m, H-1), 1.25-1.30 (1H, m, H-2), 1.42-1.60
(6H, m, H-10, 1, 10, 4, 9, 4), 1.64 (1H, dd, J = 14.4, 1.6, H-7a), 1.77
(1H, dm, J = 13.2, H-11), 2.22 (1H, d, J = 9.8, H-7), 2.51 (1H, dd, J =
14.4, 9.8, H-7), 3.34 (1H, m, H-4a), 3.57 (3H, s, OCH3), 5.63 (1H, br.s,
NH). 13C NMR spectrum (δ, ppm): 7.17 (H-17), 14.76 (H-21), 17.05 (H-20),
17.36 (C-10), 19.66 (C-1), 20.28 (C-18), 32.44 (C-11a), 35.25 (C-3),
35.59 (C-2), 35.84 (C-9), 37.20 (C-4), 39.07 (C-11), 39.60 (C-16), 44.85
(C-7), 45.39 (C-4a), 47.39 (C-7a), 48.92 (C-8), 51.86 (OCH3), 55.44
(C-11b), 177.48 (C-6), 177.90 (C-19).
